; claude: the graphics applications (CATALOG.md's section): the
; pictures made of dots and of objects, both Apple's of 1984 --
; TinyMacPaint (appkits/paint) and TinyMacDraw (appkits/draw) -- and
; what the dots became, TinyPhotoshop (libs/graphics/imaging, the
; photographs of photos/; plan_photoshop.md).
; Laid out like office/: the programs here, software/ for the golden
; frames, web/ for the browser.
;
; What else it might contain, each Tiny and after a famous original:
;  - a pixel-art editor (Deluxe Paint, 1985): palettes, brushes,
;    animation frames, colour cycling (the sprite editor, writing what
;    the games' Sprite draws, is gamedev/'s);
;  - a 3D modeller (3D Studio 1990, Blender): meshes built and turned,
;    drawn by playground3d;
;  - a font editor (Fontographer, 1986): Bezier outlines, graphics_font's
;    strokes seen the other way round.
(executables
  (names TinyMacPaint TinyMacDraw TinyPhotoshop)
  (libraries
    elm_playground
    caps ; the File menu's authority to save (File_menu, plan_caps.md)
    gui ; Widget, for text_width
    appkit_document ; Undo, Clipboard
    appkit_file_menu ; File_menu
    appkit_richtext ; Style, a text's look (TinyMacDraw)
    appkit_paint ; a picture as bits, and what paints it (TinyMacPaint)
    appkit_draw ; a picture as objects (TinyMacDraw)
    appkit_draw_view ; its figures as shapes, Figure_shapes
    appkit_stroke_text ; Hershey's strokes in a look
    graphics_imaging ; every operation of TinyPhotoshop (Lut, Mask, Brush...)
    graphics_jpeg ; our JPEG reader and writer
    graphics_png ; and PNG writer, for Export
    photos ; NASA's photographs, as strings
    elm_playground_native ; implem of virtual elm_playground
  )
)
